 "description": "Get a Hedge Opportunity by ID (v2) Returns one hedge opportunity from the selected opportunity type.\nIDs are unique within an opportunity type, not across every hedge type,\nso an ID copied from a non-mainlines feed must be requested with that\nfeed's concrete `type`. If omitted, `type` defaults to `mainlines` for\nbackwards compatibility. Only the enumerated generally available\nopportunity types are part of this public contract.\n Read-only Product data or price calculation. Use returned canonical IDs. Access, delay and metered usage follow your connected account; never infer coverage from an empty result. One bounded request, no background polling or automatic retry. Affiliate 27 is excluded. No wagers, account changes or guarantee of returns.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
